        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 6:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bukeye abiga ivy’ ukuvugishwa babarira Elisa, bat’ Ehe rāba, aho tuba haratwāgiye, nk’ uko nawe ubibona. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.6.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.6.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 6:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "None rero turakwinginze, uturekure tuje kuri Yorodani, umuntu wese yicire igiti, twiyubakireyo aho kuba. Arabishura, ati Nuko ni mugende. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.6.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.6.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 6:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Umwe muri bo aramubarira, ati Ndagusavye wemere kujana natwe abasavyi bawe. Aramwishura, ati Nuko ndaje tujane. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.6.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.6.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 6:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nuko barajana; bashitse kuri Yorodani batangura guhumbira ibiti. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.6.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.6.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 6:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Maz’ umwe muri bo, akirikw aricira igiti, incabiti imijukira mu mazi; araboroga, at’ Ewe jewe ndagowe! Erega mugenzi yar’ intīrano! ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.6.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.6.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 6:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "2KI.2.21"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "2 Abam 2:21",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Uwo muntu w’Imana aramubaza, at’ Ikorokeye hehe? Arahamwereka. Araheza aca igiti, agiterera mu mazi, ya ncabiti irareremba. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.6.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.6.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 6:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aramubarira, ati Yābīre. Atuma ukuboko arayābīra.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.6.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.6.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 6:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.6.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.6.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 6:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hār’ igihe umwami w’i Siriya yatera Abisirayeli; maz’ akaja inama n’abantu biwe, akababarira, at’ Ahanaka ni ho tuzobacira igico. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.6.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.6.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 6:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ariko Elisa wa muntu w’Imana agatuma ku mwami w’Abisirayeli, uti Wirinde, uti Ntuz’ uce ahanaka, uti Kukw ari ho Abasiriya bamanutse kugutegera. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.6.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.6.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 6:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nuk’ umwami w’Abisirayeli agaca atuma abo kumurābira aho hantu uwo muntu w’Imana yamubūriye; akagenda akira artyo si rimwe si kabiri. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.6.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.6.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 6:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ivyo bituma umwami w’i Siriya yījījanya imitima, ahamagaza abantu biwe, arababaza, ati Mbega ntimwombarira umuntu wacu ari ku ruhande rw’ umwami w’Abisirayeli uw’ ari we? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.6.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.6.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 6:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "ECC.10.20"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Umus 10:20",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Umwe mu bantu biwe aramwishura, at’ Oyaye, mwami wanje nyen’ ingoma; ariko Elisa umuvugishwa wo mu Bisirayeli ni we abarira umwami w’Abisirayeli amajambo uvugira ku kirwa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.6.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.6.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 6:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Arababarira, ati Ni mugende muhwebutse aho yoba ari, ntume abo kumufata. Baramubarira, bat’ Ar’ i Dotani. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.6.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.6.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 6:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nukw aca arungikay’ amafarasi n’ imikogote n’ingabo nyinshi; bagenda mw ijoro, bashitse baziguza ico gisagara hirya no hino.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.6.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.6.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 6:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.6.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.6.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 6:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Maz’ umusuku w’uwo muntu w’Imana, avyutse kare mu gatondo abona ingabo ziri kumwe n’amafarasi n’imikogote bajiguje ico gisagara. Uwo musuku abarira shebuja, ati Biracitse databuja! None tugira dute? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.6.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.6.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 6:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "2CH.32.7"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "2 Ngo 32:7",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "PSA.3.6"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Zab 3:6",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "ROM.8.31"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Rom 8:31",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aramwishura, ati Nta co utinya, kukw abo turi kumwe ari benshi kuruta abari kumwe na bo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.6.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.6.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 6:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "NUM.22.31"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Guh 22:31",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "2KI.2.11"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "2 Abam 2:11",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "PSA.34.7"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Zab 34:7",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Maze Elisa arasenga, at’ Uhoraho ndakwinginze, muhumūre amaso, arābe. Nuk’ Uhoraho ahumūra amaso y’uwo musore, ararāba, abona umusozi wuzuyekw amafarasi n’imikogote vy’umuriro bikikije Elisa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.6.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.6.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 6:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "GEN.19.11"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Ita 19:11",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "ACT.13.11"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Ivyak 13:11",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Za ngabo zimanutse iyo Elisa ari, asaba Uhoraho, ati Ndakwinginze, suka uruhuni mu maso y’aba bantu. Nukw abatamw’ uruhuni, nk’uko Elisa yasavye. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.6.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.6.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 6:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Elisa araheza arababarira, at’ Iyi si yo nzira, kand’ iki si co gisagara; ni munkurikire ndabashikane ku muntu murondera. Nukw abajana i Samariya.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.6.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.6.19"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 6:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.6.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.6.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 6:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bashitse i Samariya, Elisa aravuga, at’ Ewe Uhoraho, humūra amaso y’aba bantu, barābe. Nuk’ Uhoraho abahumūra amaso; bagize ngo bararāba, babona bar’ i Samariya hagati. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.6.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.6.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 6:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Umwami w’Abisirayeli ababonye, abaza Elisa, ati Mbega mutungwa, ndabice? aho sinobica? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.6.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.6.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 6:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "PRO.25.21"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Imig 25:21",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "ROM.12.20"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Rom 12:20",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aramwishura, at’ Eka ntubice: mbeg’ abo wofata mpiri kubg’ inkota yawe n’umuheto wawe, woheza ukabica? Ni babazanire ivyo kurya n’amazi, barye banywe, babone kwisubirira kwa shebuja. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.6.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.6.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 6:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "2KI.5.2"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "2 Abam 5:2",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nukw abarondereza ivyo kurya vyinshi; bamaze kurya no kunywa arabarungika, basubira kwa shebuja. Maz’ uhereye ubgo, ibitero vy’Abasiriya ntivyongera kuza mu gihugu c’Abisirayeli.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.6.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.6.23"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
